5,0,1,talk,Misaki,,Let's keep things objective. I'll be looking for contradictions in everyone's statements.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I'm not sure what to look for. I'll just try my best to listen to everyone.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Asuka,,Logic is the only reliable tool here. I will be analyzing speech patterns and inconsistencies to find the werewolf.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Ryuji,,I agree with Asuka. Intuition is useless. We should focus on the validity of the claims made.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Midori,,"It's a bit nerve-wracking, isn't it? Let's all try to be honest and work together harmoniously.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Daisuke, don't be too nervous. Just tell us if something feels off.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Daisuke,,"Thanks, Misaki. I'll try... but I'm afraid of making a mistake.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Asuka,,Fear is a distraction. We need a baseline of how everyone speaks normally before the accusations start.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Ryuji,,Exactly. Any sudden shift in tone or logic tomorrow will be a red flag.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Midori,,That sounds like a good plan. I'll do my best to stay calm and helpful.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Misaki,,Does anyone have a specific strategy for the first vote?,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Daisuke,,Maybe we should wait and see who acts the most suspicious?,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Asuka,,Waiting is passive. We should cross-reference the Seer's information once it's revealed.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Ryuji,,"If a Seer claims a role, we must verify if their ""findings"" align with the players' behavior.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Midori,,I think it's important to support each other so we don't accidentally target a villager.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Misaki,,Agreed. I'm ready for the first night.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
