36,1,1,talk,Misaki,,"The first day has begun. Asuka, since you're usually the most direct, do you have any leads?","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I don't know who to trust yet.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"I am the Seer. I divined Ryuji last night, and he is the werewolf.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,That is a bold claim. There is no evidence other than your word. You could be the werewolf lying to frame me.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,1,talk,Midori,,"Oh dear, such a strong start! Asuka, are you absolutely sure about this?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Ryuji, how do you respond to the logic of a Seer claiming you immediately?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"If Asuka is the Seer, then Ryuji is the wolf... but what if she's lying?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,2,talk,Asuka,,My role is certain. Ryuji's immediate defensive reaction is a typical pattern for a caught werewolf.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,Logic dictates that a werewolf would claim to be the Seer to eliminate a threat. Asuka is playing that role perfectly.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,2,talk,Midori,,It's hard to tell. Both of you sound so convinced. Maybe we should look at others?,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Misaki,,"@Midori, you seem hesitant. Do you see any reason to doubt Asuka?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I think Asuka seems more honest, but I'm scared of being wrong.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"Midori is being overly cautious, which could be a sign of the Possessed trying to create doubt.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"That's a leap in logic, Asuka. You're trying to paint everyone who doesn't immediately agree with you as an enemy.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,3,talk,Midori,,I just want us to be sure! I don't want to execute an innocent person.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Misaki,,"The evidence is a direct claim from the Seer. Unless we have a counter-claim, Ryuji is the primary suspect.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,I'll go with what seems most logical... I think I trust Asuka.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,1,4,talk,Asuka,,The fact remains: Ryuji is the werewolf. The village should act now.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,You are making a mistake based on a lie. But I cannot prove my innocence without a divine result.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
55,1,4,talk,Midori,,"If everyone is leaning that way, I suppose we have to decide.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
